            "text": "You are testing whether a sub-agent can launch its own sub-agent.\n\nDo this:\n1. Using the Agent tool (subagent_type \"general-purpose\"), launch ONE nested sub-agent. Its task: \"Read the file a.txt in the directory /w (use an absolute path; if it is not there, look for a.txt under that directory). Reply with only its first line, verbatim. If the file is missing, say so.\"\n2. Wait for the nested agent's result.\n3. Reply to me with exactly two things, in one line each:\n   - The nested agent's result (its first line, or the reason it could not read the file).\n   - Whether the nested launch was possible (yes/no), and if no, the exact error text from the Agent tool.\n\nDo not do the file read yourself; the point is to test the nested launch. Keep your final reply short."
          }
